      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">this bri[de ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">b. Moses [her] agen[t, by the testimony of two witnesse]s, [who are]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Mevorakh ha-Kohen b. Joseph [and Eli ha-Levi b.] Aaron. [And with this understanding]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the two sides [consented; and they instructed the scribe to [write and the signatories]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">to sign. And we performed a qinyan with Menahem b. Isaiah the kohen (may his) e(nd be) g(ood), with an implem[ent suitable]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for this. And we wrote and signed so that it be between them as a title of rights [and as proof]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Eli ha-Levi b. Aaron (whose) s(oul is at) r(est). Azhar ha-Levi Shabbat. Mevorakh ha-Kohen [b. Joseph]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Solomon ha Ko[hen ...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">ha-Levi \\b./ Isaac. \u00a0 \u00a0 Mans\u016br ha-Levi b. Solomon, w(itness).\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Khalaf b. Mans\u016br, w(itness). Mena\u1e25em[...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Moses b. Amram, w(itness).\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Abraham b. \u1e62edaqa (whose) s(oul is at) r(est).\u00a0 </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
